The language of this page: English. Every word of it is English: <title>, <h1>, every heading, label, table header, chart title and series name, even where the evidence and the design kit hold Arabic; a name the evidence gives only in Arabic is transliterated. Never write a source label such as "General knowledge" or «من المعرفة العامة» in the page; the platform adds one after each figure.
